        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "study_index": 4,
        "title": "Effects of vincamin on cerebral metabolism",
        "decision": "EXCLUDE",
        "rationale": "Does not meet criteria: main focus is vincamin, not theophylline/analogue. Small aminophylline 
